  "id": "ngt",
  "term": "NGT",
  "definition": "NGT, or Nominal Group Technique, is a structured method for generating consensus within a group of people who have relevant knowledge about a topic. It typically involves individuals first producing ideas on their own, then sharing and clarifying them in turn, followed by private scoring or ranking to identify priorities or agreement.",
